msgid "控制台与诊断"
msgstr "Console and Diagnostics"

msgid "VT 与日志"
msgstr "VTs and Logs"

msgid ""
"文本 VT 与图形会话共享内核设备，切换时必须正确交还显示和输入。 启动串口日志可用于没有图形输出的情况。内核启动徽标按发现的逻辑 CPU 数量 "
"显示，启动完成前自动移除；它不是物理插槽数量的指示器。 ``logcolor=0`` 禁用内核日志颜色，``bootlog-pause=1`` "
"用于启动日志暂停检查。 不要把只到达 GRUB 页面作为启动成功。"
msgstr ""
"Text VTs and graphical sessions share kernel devices, so display and input "
"control must be handed back correctly when switching. Boot serial logs can "
"help when graphical output is unavailable. The kernel boot logo reflects the"
" number of detected logical CPUs and is removed automatically before boot "
"completes; it does not indicate the number of physical sockets. "
"``logcolor=0`` disables kernel log colors, and ``bootlog-pause=1`` pauses "
"boot logs for inspection. Reaching the GRUB screen alone does not count as a"
" successful boot."

msgid "崩溃报告"
msgstr "Crash Reports"

msgid ""
"Kernel panic 在当前文本 VT 输出诊断；在 GUI 中从左上角绘制黑底字符格， 保留其他像素。完整诊断继续写串口和 VT "
"历史。记录异常码、RIP、CR2/CR3、 CPU/任务、内核版本和源码身份，使用同一构建的调试符号定位。 没有目标虚拟机故障注入的测试，不能宣称 "
"panic 显示已在该平台通过。"
msgstr ""
"A kernel panic prints diagnostics on the current text VT. In the GUI, it "
"draws character cells on a black background from the upper-left corner, "
"preserving the remaining pixels. Complete diagnostics continue to be written"
" to serial output and VT history. Record the exception code, RIP, CR2/CR3, "
"CPU/task, kernel version, and source identity, and use debug symbols from "
"the same build to locate the fault. Without fault-injection testing on the "
"target virtual machine, do not claim that panic display has passed testing "
"on that platform."
